:: OC Tyler Arcade Confident [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
<<set $Money -= 1>>
You are walking around the arcade, deciding what game to invest your quarters in, when you hear a voice call out in triumph. Something about the voice seems oddly familiar, but there is also something about it that also seems… wrong? No, not wrong. Different? You can’t put your finger on it, but it just sounds off! You follow the sound of the voice, happily chuckling and hyping themselves up. Whoever this is, it sounds like they have a lot of confidence and you try to put a face to the voice when you suddenly are shocked to see who it is! 

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Tyler",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Mad",

            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Tyler</span>! <span style="color:Pink">The small, shy boy from your school that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> was bullying who is too shy to hold eye-contact with you for more than a moment.</span> You see him playing a military shooter game, <span style="color:LightGreen">a confident smirk on his face as he headshots everyone with ease. Instead of pointing the gun offscreen to reload, he spins it with his fingers like some sort of cowboy, before going back to perfectly shooting everyone in his path! It is honestly super impressive!</span> As the <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Level Completed!”</span> letters appear on the screen, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Tyler</span> chuckles and blows the pretend smoke out of his gun. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Not bad, but the Confederation is safe in my hands!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Tyler</span> says confidently, quoting the words on screen. <span style="color:LightGreen">It is really weird seeing him with such confidence and you can’t help but clap to congratulate the boy’s victory!</span> Hearing your clapping, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Tyler</span> spins around and, upon seeing you, <span style="color:Pink">suddenly loses every cool bone in his body. He blushes, gets his foot suddenly tangled in the gun’s cord, and faceplants into the ground. There’s the <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Tyler</span> you know! You quickly run over to help the boy up, now with a bruised nose.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, umm…”</span> He gulps, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Did- did you see-?”</span> You chuckle and nod. It was pretty cool! You didn’t know he had such skill! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Tyler</span> <span style="color:Pink">sinks back to the ground, turning even redder. Seems he can only be that confident when he’s alone.</span> You spend a few minutes trying to hype him up, but it is clear that energy has left him. You offer to play some games with him and, while he accepts, his skills seem to have vanished as well. <span style="color:Pink">What a strange yet adorable boy.</span> <br>
<<needChange "Fun" 20>>
<<needChange "Energy" -4>>
<<socialChange "Tyler" 3 1>>
<br>
[[Continue|Arcade]]